WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.501
The border is done.

00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:06.621
Every gold sheet is in its place, and the glass stays clear.

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:12.275
So, how can you find the area of a shape that isn't a simple rectangle?

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:14.737
See the rectangles inside it.

00:00:15.325 --> 00:00:19.067
Split the shape into rectangles and add their areas.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.641
Or find the whole rectangle and take away the part that is missing.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.402
For a border or a path, add it on both sides first.

00:00:28.978 --> 00:00:30.248
Then take away the middle.

00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:34.416
Next time, the Duke wants a fence around his new garden.

00:00:35.085 --> 00:00:37.109
A fence doesn't cover the garden.

00:00:37.686 --> 00:00:39.118
It goes around the edge.

00:00:39.312 --> 00:00:40.407
That's perimeter.

00:00:41.169 --> 00:00:42.589
See you in the workshop.
